      "statusChangeID": "6500a6c02ed879097ba87b76",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Hello,\n\nWe appreciate your feedback. However, this request is far too broad and unspecific to do anything with, so unfortunately I'm going to have to close this post. In the future, please take care to make feature requests more specific so that they are actionable.\n\nAdditionally, we're well aware that people want these things so there's not much of a point in making a new feature request to repeat them. The reason they haven't been done already is because these are directly contradictory to our current goals of improving performance and reducing crashes on quest, which is already very strained as is. I hope you understand that these goals are set in place to improve the experience for everyone, even if that may not be what you specifically want.",
